{"schema_version":1,"revision":"601e84afb0ba06e12eaea5c6902ae0892651b922c31c1708c5f8a67b0d13b049","source_loaded_at":"2026-10-16T18:17:50.161Z","links":{"search":"https://agenthub-feedback.haoqingeric.workers.dev/content/search","editions":"https://agenthub-feedback.haoqingeric.workers.dev/content/editions","library":"https://agenthub-feedback.haoqingeric.workers.dev/library/search"},"query":{"q":"有没有群友介绍过可以检查论文引用真假的写作工具?把工具代码链接、它怎么核验文献、群里在哪些版面提过给我,别声称它保证不会幻觉。","kind":"","group":"","from":"","to":""},"coverage":{"indexed":["story_summaries","ai_commentary","library_entries"],"not_indexed":["raw_chat","edition_trends"],"edition_reader":"https://agenthub-feedback.haoqingeric.workers.dev/content/editions"},"total":2,"limit":5,"offset":0,"next_offset":null,"next_url":null,"items":[{"id":"weekly:2026-10-05:2026-10-11:group-3:dcb7b9153e71a991d766c630","kind":"weekly","date":"2026-10-11","from":"2026-10-05","group":"group-3","title":"Open Academic Paper Gen把引文核验放进写作流水线","excerpt":"群友在群内分享了开源论文辅助编写项目Open Academic Paper Gen。该工具构建了一个包含九阶段的多智能体流水线，用户输入研究课题后，据分享者介绍，系统输出以检索文献为依据的学术论文草稿。

据分享者介绍，该项目的设计重心在于引文核验而非单纯的内容扩写。流水线要求正文中的每个引用都必须映射到已检索的文献池，并依次通过三层验证机制：核查引文是否存在于候选文献池、核对DOI与作者/年份/页码元数据的一致性、以及校验被引原文是否真正支持正文论断。检测到引用瑕疵时系统会在条件约束下改写重验，并在末期引入三位模拟审稿人独立挑错。项目支持中英文撰写，兼容Markdown、LaTeX、RIS与BibTeX格式导出，但定位仍为辅助工具，并非绝对消除大模型幻觉的保证。","keywords":[],"url":"https://hqhq1025.github.io/agent_hub/weekly/2026-10-05/2026-10-11/group-3/#topic-17","read_url":"https://agenthub-feedback.haoqingeric.workers.dev/read/agents/topics/weekly:2026-10-05:2026-10-11:group-3:dcb7b9153e71a991d766c630.md","revision":"5e8a4d0b4220deaab2f1f5dff4247aaf8f6388ba37fb16493d6f63fd5a12ddc0","detail_url":"https://agenthub-feedback.haoqingeric.workers.dev/content/item?id=weekly%3A2026-10-05%3A2026-10-11%3Agroup-3%3Adcb7b9153e71a991d766c630&revision=601e84afb0ba06e12eaea5c6902ae0892651b922c31c1708c5f8a67b0d13b049"},{"id":"weekly:2026-10-05:2026-10-11:group-4:666fe7bcd54449306bce94c8","kind":"weekly","date":"2026-10-11","from":"2026-10-05","group":"group-4","title":"Open Academic Paper Gen 的文献核验流水线","excerpt":"10月7日，作者在群内介绍了已开源的论文辅助编写工具 Open Academic Paper Gen。据作者自述，该工具采用九阶段多智能体流水线，用户输入研究话题后可生成附带文献支撑的论文草稿，整体设计核心偏向“查”而非单纯生成。

在流水线中，正文引用的文献需先进入检索文献池，随后经历三层核验：确认引用是否对齐文献池、核对 DOI 与作者及年份等元数据、检验被引原文是否真正支持对应论断。若发现问题，系统会在约束下改写并再次核验，最后交由三位模拟审稿人挑错。项目遵循 AGPL-3.0 协议，支持中英文写作及 Markdown、LaTeX、RIS 和 BibTeX 等格式导出。","keywords":[],"url":"https://hqhq1025.github.io/agent_hub/weekly/2026-10-05/2026-10-11/group-4/#topic-18","read_url":"https://agenthub-feedback.haoqingeric.workers.dev/read/agents/topics/weekly:2026-10-05:2026-10-11:group-4:666fe7bcd54449306bce94c8.md","revision":"a418f7a89cdfa4afdf898a0f57772624c2e022a53723c33cc39f0cf107afec5a","detail_url":"https://agenthub-feedback.haoqingeric.workers.dev/content/item?id=weekly%3A2026-10-05%3A2026-10-11%3Agroup-4%3A666fe7bcd54449306bce94c8&revision=601e84afb0ba06e12eaea5c6902ae0892651b922c31c1708c5f8a67b0d13b049"}]}
